     - the compiler and its source (`compiler/`), the hosts, the tests or the
       documentation in this repository — those stay Apache-2.0 OR MIT;
     - any file of this project you copy into your own tree by hand rather than
       receiving as Compiler Output. `runtime/ml_abi.h` is such a file: it is
       hand-written, and `mlc` never copies it into your output, so it is not
       Compiler Output. (This repository's own acceptance-D harness compiles it
       standalone to check it is valid C — measured 2026-09-03 — but that is a
       test of ours, not something `mlc` hands to you.);
