4. Why it is worded as an exception rather than left implicit

   Apache-2.0 and MIT are permissive, not obligation-free: both ask that the
   notice be preserved in redistributed copies. Read strictly, that could be
   taken to follow our template text into every header a user ships. The point of
   this project is that a user's algorithm goes out as a protected module without
   our terms riding along (DECISIONS.md D04), so the question is answered here
   in writing instead of being left to inference.

   The shape of the problem is a known one — the GNU Compiler Collection carries
   a Runtime Library Exception for the same reason, though under a copyleft
   licence the stakes there are far higher than attribution.


